,"text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPickerData"},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition the root item of the picker has for accessiiblity identifier the displayed text."}]},{"anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","type":"heading","text":"Forbidden by design","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in both an error situation and a read only state.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both a read only and a disabled state."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in checkboxes using OUDSCheckboxPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the OUDSCheckboxItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional with default values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>] {","        [","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<